  "10": {
    "action": "confirm",
    "canonical": "Use fixtures (rather than old xUnit setup/teardown) to separate 'get ready' (setup) from 'clean up' (teardown): in a yield fixture the code before yield is setup and the code after yield is guaranteed-to-run teardown, autouse=True applies a fixture without naming it, and fixtures can be consumed by tests or composed by other fixtures."
  },
